{"step_index":241,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T19:40:18Z","thinking":"**Refining Network Analysis Presentation**\n\nSimplifying the header to \"OPERATION CHAKRAVYUH // CRIMINAL NETWORK GRAPH\" makes the presentation cleaner. The subtitle will succinctly highlight key insights: \"5–8 Core Entities • Direct Hawala Conduits, Vehicle Ownership & Burner Phone Links.\" Pathfinder needs updating to show the direct flow from `Rahul Verma (Kingpin)` through `Amit Yadav` to the `Canara Bank Hawala Acct` with the total amount. The focus remains on clarity and impact for the hackathon.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState } from 'react'\\nimport { \\n  Share2, \\n  Download, \\n  Route, \\n  Zap, \\n  Info,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  ArrowRight\\n} from 'lucide-react'\\nimport { mockNetworkGraph, mockEntities } from '../data/mockData'\\nimport { NetworkGraphContainer } from '../components/network/NetworkGraphContainer'\\nimport { Button } from '../components/ui/button'\\nimport { Badge } from '../components/ui/badge'\\nimport { Card } from '../components/ui/card'\\n\\nexport const NetworkAnalysisPage: React.FC = () => {\\n  const [pathfinderOpen, setPathfinderOpen] = useState(false)\\n  const [sourceNode, setSourceNode] = useState('ent-1')\\n  const [targetNode, setTargetNode] = useState('ent-2')\\n  const [pathResult, setPathResult] = useState<string[] | null>(null)\\n\\n  const handleRunPathfinder = () => {\\n    // Demonstration of shortest criminal link between Rahul Verma and target\\n    if (targetNode === 'ent-b1' || targetNode === 'ent-2') {\\n      setPathResult([\\n        'Rahul Verma (Kingpin - Delhi)',\\n        'Amit Yadav (Hawala Handler - Ghaziabad)',\\n        'Canara Bank Hawala Acct (₹12.5L Wire)'\\n      ])\\n    } else {\\n      setPathResult([\\n        'Rahul Verma (Delhi)',\\n        'Suresh Sharma (Logistics)',\\n        'Mahindra Scorpio (UP14 AB