{"step_index":293,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T19:42:49Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. Build the frontend for a project called NEXUS, an AI-powered criminal network analysis dashboard.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\n* React\r\n* Vite\r\n* TypeScript\r\n* Tailwind CSS\r\n* React Router\r\n* shadcn/ui\r\n* Responsive desktop-first design\r\n* Professional law-enforcement intelligence dashboard style\r\n* Dark/light professional UI\r\n* No excessive animations\r\n\r\nCreate these pages:\r\n\r\n1. Login\r\n2. Dashboard\r\n3. Cases\r\n4. Upload Evidence\r\n5. Network Analysis\r\n6. Entity Profile\r\n7. Investigation Timeline\r\n8. Settings\r\n\r\nCreate reusable components:\r\n\r\n* Sidebar\r\n* Top navigation\r\n* Metric cards\r\n* Data tables\r\n* Network graph container\r\n* Evidence cards\r\n* Entity cards\r\n* Alert cards\r\n\r\nFor now use mock data only.\r\n\r\nDo not create the backend yet.\r\n\r\nRun the project and make sure all routes work.\r\n\n2. host\n3. host\n4. host\n5. We are currently building the frontend prototype of NEXUS, an AI-powered criminal network analysis system for an Indian Smart India Hackathon project.\r\n\r\nPlease inspect the existing frontend code first. Do not rebuild the project from scratch.\r\n\r\nOur current frontend is too complex and uses mostly US-style names and data. I want you to simplify it while preserving the existing React/Vite structure and functionality.\r\n\r\nRequired changes:\r\n\r\n1. Replace US names with Indian sample names:\r\n\r\n   * Rahul Verma\r\n   * Amit Yadav\r\n   * Priya Singh\r\n   * Suresh Sharma\r\n   * Neha Gupta\r\n\r\n2. Replace US locations with In